{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……应该没事吧」", "text_idx": 134, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4484", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你指什么？」", "text_idx": 137, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1643", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个呆子和天羽学姐」", "text_idx": 139, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4485", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那也不是我们该担心的事吧」", "text_idx": 141, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1644", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话是这么说……\\n　但恋人的话，不是更应该为她打气吗？」", "text_idx": 143, "plain": "「话是这么说……　但恋人的话，不是更应该为她打气吗？」", "plain_idx": 144, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4486", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明明谁都看得出来，\\n　天羽学姐现在还在勉强着自己……」", "text_idx": 146, "plain": "「明明谁都看得出来，　天羽学姐现在还在勉强着自己……」", "plain_idx": 147, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4487", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 149, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1645", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我为什么会这么在意这种事情啊」", "text_idx": 151, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4488", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈～嗯，难道说是喜欢上新吾了？」", "text_idx": 153, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1646", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要乱说话好吗」", "text_idx": 155, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4489", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好好好，应该说，爱理大人是个关心伙伴的人呐」", "text_idx": 157, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1647", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「别取笑我了，真是的……」", "text_idx": 159, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4490", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 149, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1648", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……只不过，你为什么这么冷静？」", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4491", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯？」", "text_idx": 164, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1649", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽学姐被抢走了，\\n　而且那家伙还没鼓励正受伤着的学姐」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": "「美羽学姐被抢走了，　而且那家伙还没鼓励正受伤着的学姐」", "plain_idx": 167, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4492", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1650", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么嘛，才发现吗」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4493", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那是因为我已经承认了」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1651", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「承认了？」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4494", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾挺能干的」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1652", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哪里能干了呀，那个家伙，\\n　不是就只是在笑眯眯地看别人脸色吗」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": "「哪里能干了呀，那个家伙，　不是就只是在笑眯眯地看别人脸色吗」", "plain_idx": 180, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4495", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看来你理解不了呀……」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1653", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎？」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4496", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「正是因为他没有轻易地去鼓励学姐，才说明他能干」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1654", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……正是因为他还能笑眯眯的，\\n　学姐现在才能还有精神不是吗」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": "「……正是因为他还能笑眯眯的，　学姐现在才能还有精神不是吗」", "plain_idx": 189, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1655", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
